# Ambitious Augmenter ({G}, 1/1): Increment, and "When this creature dies, if it had one or more counters on it, create a 0/0 Fractal
# token, then put this creature's counters on that token." Bot1 casts a two-mana Lightning Helix: more than its power 1, so
# increment gives it a +1/+1 counter (2/2). Lightning Bolt (one mana, not more than 2) kills it: the Fractal made as it dies gets
# the counter, a 1/1.

